{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_01_feature_layer", "label": "Feature Layer: Vocabulary + Cross-Sectional Context Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_dsl_eval_xs", "label": "_eval_xs()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A normal feature receives its argument already evaluated for one symbol, so xs_rank must be a marker special-cased in the evaluator exactly as htf(tf, expr) already is; peer bars are aligned point-in-time with searchsorted side=right minus one."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features", "label": "Feature Registry Module (trader/strategy/features.py)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_featurectx", "label": "FeatureCtx", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "for_symbol returns a context with a fresh cache because the memo key is (name, tf, args) with no symbol component; sharing the parent cache would return this symbol's values for every other symbol."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_register", "label": "register()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "arg_specs and domain drive automatic parameter-range inference for the optimizer; they are not documentation."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_deriv_funding_pct", "label": "funding_pct()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A percentile survives regime shifts in the level that a z-score does not."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_deriv_oi_price_div", "label": "oi_price_div()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open interest building against the price move: positioning growing into a decline is a different animal from one growing into a rally."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_xs", "label": "Cross-Sectional Features Module (trader/strategy/features_xs.py)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The strongest single predictor of the next 8 hours on this repo's cached data was rel_strength_btc at IC -0.15 to -0.17 in every regime, and it is the only cross-asset feature that exists; these generalise it to the whole universe."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_xs_xs_rank", "label": "xs_rank() marker", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_xs_breadth", "label": "breadth() marker", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_xs_dispersion", "label": "dispersion() marker", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_efficiency_ratio", "label": "efficiency_ratio()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kaufman: distance travelled over path walked \u2014 1.0 is a straight line, near 0 is chop. The cleanest trend-versus-noise discriminator available from price alone."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_bars_since", "label": "bars_since()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NaN until the condition has been true at least once \u2014 never-happened is unknown, not zero."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_streak", "label": "streak()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_swing_high", "label": "swing_high()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pivot at bar i needs n later bars to confirm, so the level is shifted forward by n before use \u2014 reporting it at i would be lookahead."}, {"id": "trader_strategy_features_macd", "label": "macd()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-01-feature-layer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captur